# MoonStore — Vite project

This application is built with Vite (React + Vite).

Quick start
1. Clone the repository and enter the folder:
```bash
git clone https://github.com/LerkonoID/MoonStore-React-project.git
cd MoonStore-React-project
```

2. Install dependencies:
```bash
npm install
# or
yarn install
# or
pnpm install
```

3. Run in development mode (Vite):
```bash
npm run dev
# or
yarn dev
# or
pnpm dev
```
The Vite dev server defaults to http://localhost:5173

Build and preview (production)
```bash
npm run build
# then (to preview the built app locally)
npm run preview
```
Vite preview defaults to http://localhost:4173

Notes
- Node.js is required (LTS recommended, e.g. >=16).
- Environment variables for this project should start with the VITE_ prefix (for example: VITE_API_URL).